      "content": "right, but it feels like a lot of those \"freedom\" arguments are just people falling for conspiracy theories about movement restrictions or lockdowns. like, the actual plans are just about walking to the grocery store, not being locked in. dont you think most of these fears are just based on misinformation rather than what's actually happening?",
